     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "mn[1]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "To predict, the branch address picks the entry, and the global history picks the counter inside it. So the same branch gets a different prediction depending on what just happened."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "mn[2]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "In this notation the plain 2-bit table from part 1 is a (0, 2) predictor: no history at all."
