      "en": "The (1, 1) predictor is wrong at 1 and 2 while it warms up, then right at 3 and 4. At 5, b1 after a not taken uses the entry trained to taken: wrong. b2 at 6 gets it right. At 7, b1 after not taken again: the entry now says not taken, wrong. b2 at 8, right. 4 of 8."
